title: Palo Alto Networks: VPN IPsec tunnels (phase 2)
agents: paloalto_api
catalog: hw/network/paloalto
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-paloalto-api
description:
 Monitors the IPsec tunnels ("show vpn flow") of a firewall. The service is OK
 if the tunnel is active and at least one IPsec security association is
 installed ("show vpn ipsec-sa"), WARN if it is active without SA, and CRIT
 (configurable) if the tunnel is in state init. The tunnel monitor status and
 the remaining lifetime of the SAs are reported as well. On the passive member
 of an HA pair tunnels are down by design; the service is OK there by default.

item:
 The name of the IPsec tunnel.

discovery:
 One service is created per configured IPsec tunnel.
